# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:15
translate turkish jamies3_30789021:

    # gnd "Hm, favorite food?"
    gnd "Hm, en sevdiğim yemek mi?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:16
translate turkish jamies3_93f44801:

    # gnd "Does coffee count?"
    gnd "Kahve sayılır mı?"

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:17
translate turkish jamies3_2cdd0d03:

    # pc "I mean, I guess. It's kind of a drink though, not a food."
    pc "Yani, sanırım sayılır. Ama aslında bir içecek, yemek sayılmaz."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:19
translate turkish jamies3_25e51b32:

    # gnd "Okay, well I guess ice cream then. Chocolate chip."
    gnd "Tamam, o zaman dondurma diyelim. Çikolata parçacıklı."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:20
translate turkish jamies3_0bb3b188:

    # pc "Good choice."
    pc "İyi seçim."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:21
translate turkish jamies3_d5fe7791:

    # gnd "I thought so. I try not to eat it too much though."
    gnd "Ben de öyle düşünmüştüm. Ama çok fazla yememeye çalışıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:22
translate turkish jamies3_02386a2a:

    # gnd "I already don't work out enough and spend too much time in front of the TV, so if I added ice cream to that, I'd probably just turn into a big doughball."
    gnd "Zaten yeterince egzersiz yapmıyorum ve televizyon başında çok fazla zaman geçiriyorum, bir de dondurmayı eklesem, muhtemelen kocaman bir hamur topuna dönüşürdüm."

# game/Scenes/Jamie/JamieConversation/jamiesurface3.rpy:23
translate turkish jamies3_7e892aec:

    # gnd "But for special occasions, or when I really get a craving, chocolate chip ice cream is my go-to."
    gnd "Ama özel günlerde ya da canım gerçekten çektiğinde, çikolata parçacıklı dondurma benim vazgeçilmezimdir."

